stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> EXEC_INACTIVE
    EXEC_INACTIVE --> EXEC_COLLECT: MULTI / SendOk
    EXEC_COLLECT --> EXEC_COLLECT: 普通命令<br/>StoreInMultiBlock + QUEUED
    EXEC_COLLECT --> EXEC_ERROR: 收集期校验失败
    EXEC_COLLECT --> EXEC_RUNNING: EXEC 校验成功
    EXEC_ERROR --> EXEC_INACTIVE: EXECABORT + MultiCleanup
    EXEC_COLLECT --> EXEC_INACTIVE: DISCARD + MultiCleanup
    EXEC_RUNNING --> EXEC_INACTIVE: 执行、UnlockMulti、MultiCleanup
